        "TileImage": "$($repository bc6da930-0bde-4442-bfe7-8a10a0b8df61).Image",
        "Description": "Good day, 47. Our client has requested that we eliminate three employees of the notorious Ark Society. Specifically the two main helicopter mechanics and one of their personal guards.\r\rThese three targets are extremely high profile and well regarded in their field so we have no doubt that this will stir some trouble within the society. Removing the mechanics renders the helicopter useless to the society and its members.\r\rTake care, 47. Happy hunting.",
